== Trivia ==
* In the original Binding of Isaac, {{e|Blighted Ovum}} could appear as a boss.
* The backdrop of the Catacombs is a cave, similar to the {{s|Caves}}, but darker and with ocassional pillars or skulls in the walls.

== Unlockable [[Achievement]]s ==
{{achievement text | Something Cute, Telekinesis, Spelunker Boy }}

== Music ==
* The [[music]] for the Catacombs is titled ''Capiticus Calvaria''.<ref>[https://ridiculon.bandcamp.com/album/the-binding-of-isaac-rebirth-ost Binding of Isaac: Rebirth OST]</ref>
** Calvaria is Latin for "Skull", and while Capiticus does not have a true definition, it most likely comes from the word Caput, meaning "Head", or Capitulum, meaning "Chapter".

